---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '@/styles/case-unified.css';
const a = (name: string) => `/viz-case/${name}.jpg`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="可视化查询 · 设计重构"
  description="从产品定位、用户研究到四项设计策略，重构数据分析编辑器，并以分期验证完成版本迁移。"
  closing={false}
>
  <article class="case-media-hover viz-case pdf-case">
    <header class="shell hero case-header">
      <nav aria-label="面包屑" class="case-header-breadcrumb rise">
        <a href="/">作品案例</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span aria-current="page">可视化查询设计重构</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="case-header-title rise" style="--rise-step: 2">从取数到分析，重新理顺工作的路径</h1>
      <p class="intro case-header-intro rise" style="--rise-step: 3">
        同一套编辑器，要让简单取数更容易，也要承接持续深入的分析。这次重构从产品定位和用户任务出发，重新组织框架、配置、学习与视觉体验
      </p>
      <dl class="case-header-meta rise" style="--rise-step: 4">
        <div>
          <dt>我的职责</dt>
          <dd>项目设计 Owner</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>工作范围</dt>
          <dd>专家走查、需求梳理、用户访谈、框架优化、交互与视觉设计</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt>项目结果</dt>
          <dd>新版上线一个月后，UV 占比均值 66.4%</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </header>
    <section class="shell section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="overline tracking-[0.08em]">01 / 产品介绍</p>
        <h2 class="text-balance">它是制图工具，也是取数与分析的工作台</h2>
        <p class="text-pretty">
          图表生产：将数据转换成图表展示
          <br />
          数据查询：无需SQL，从数据库捞取目标数据
          <br />
          探索分析：使用分析功能，挖掘数据之间的隐藏关联
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="product-preview">
        <div class="product-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="产品界面占位图">
          产品界面 · 待补充
        </div>
      </figure>
    </section>
    <section class="shell section background-section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="overline">02 / 背景与问题</p>
        <h2 class="text-balance">功能已经很多，完成任务却不够顺畅</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="problem-layout">
        <aside class="problem-card" aria-label="关键问题">
          <span class="problem-label">关键问题</span>
          <dl class="problem-list">
            <div>
              <dt>页面坪效低下</dt>
              <dd>功能平铺，图表区域展示高度有限</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>信息架构混乱</dt>
              <dd>内容分类不合理，用户理解成本增加</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>扩展性僵化</dt>
              <dd>新增功能用户难以发现</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>视觉风格老旧</dt>
              <dd>页面视觉效果差、精致度低</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </aside>
        <figure class="product-preview problem-preview" id="legacy-preview">
          <img
            src="/viz-case/legacy-aeolus.png"
            alt="重构前的风神可视化查询界面"
            width="1728"
            height="910"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="shell section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="overline tracking-[0.08em]">03 / 调研与策略</p>
        <h2 class="text-balance !leading-[150%]">
          理解用户差异、借鉴成熟方案，
          <br />
          制定设计策略
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-16 flex flex-col gap-5">
        {['01', '02', '03'].map((number) => (
          <img
            src={`/viz-case/research-strategy-${number}.png`}
            alt={`调研与策略 ${number}`}
            class="aspect-video w-full rounded-3xl object-cover"
            width="1200"
            height="675"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="shell section flexible-section" id="structure">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="overline">04 / 方案设计·灵活拓展</p>
        <h2>先让工作有顺序，再让界面有弹性</h2>
        <p>从字段到配置，再到结果，三类用户的工作都可以沿着同一条路径展开。框架不再围绕功能堆叠，而是围绕任务组织</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flexible-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="灵活拓展方案">
        <button
          id="flex-tab-0"
          class="flexible-tab"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="true"
          aria-controls="flex-panel"
          tabindex="0"
        >
          <span>页面框架</span>
          <small>字段 → 配置 → 结果</small>
          <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        <button
          id="flex-tab-1"
          class="flexible-tab"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="flex-panel"
          tabindex="-1"
        >
          <span>工具条</span>
          <small>没有所有人共同的“高频”</small>
          <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        <button
          id="flex-tab-2"
          class="flexible-tab"
          type="button"
          role="tab"
          aria-selected="false"
          aria-controls="flex-panel"
          tabindex="-1"
        >
          <span>筛选布局</span>
          <small>在屏效与调整成本之间取舍</small>
          <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div id="flex-panel" class="flexible-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="flex-tab-0" tabindex="0">
        <img
          src="/viz-case/flexible-01.png"
          alt="页面框架：字段、配置与结果"
          width="3840"
          height="2160"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="shell section flexible-section" id="efficiency">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="overline">04 / 方案设计·配置提效</p>
        <h2>把反复调整，变成更接近任务的选择</h2>
        <p>用户来编辑器是为了得到结果。把常见场景沉淀为预设，把连续分析放回结果旁边，配置才真正服务于工作</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="flexible-tabs"
        style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))"
        role="tablist"
        aria-label="配置提效方案"
      >
        {['图表预设', '分析配置'].map((title, index) => (
          <button
            id={`eff-tab-${index}`}
            class="flexible-tab"
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            aria-selected={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
            aria-controls="eff-panel"
            tabindex={index === 0 ? 0 : -1}
          >
            <span>{title}</span>
            <small>{index === 0 ? '封装场景里的最佳实践' : '观察与调整同时发生'}</small>
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div id="eff-panel" class="flexible-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="eff-tab-0" tabindex="0">
        <img src="/viz-case/efficiency-01.png" alt="图表预设" width="3840" height="2160" />
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="shell section flexible-section learning-section" id="learning">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="overline">04 / 方案设计·简单易学</p>
        <h2>让界面解释能力，让用户看见结果</h2>
        <p>当一个选项难以理解时，更多术语并不能帮助用户。示例、业务语言、空态和帮助文档共同构成了学习路径</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flexible-tabs learning-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="简单易学方案">
        {[
          ['复杂配置', '把规则和例子放在一起'],
          ['查询表达', '从代码转成业务语言'],
          ['图表空态', '没放入数据，也知道怎么开始'],
          ['帮助文档', '用熟悉的故事解释陌生概念'],
        ].map(([title, description], index) => (
          <button
            id={`learn-tab-${index}`}
            class="flexible-tab"
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            aria-selected={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
            aria-controls="learn-panel"
            tabindex={index === 0 ? 0 : -1}
          >
            <span>{title}</span>
            <small>{description}</small>
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div id="learn-panel" class="flexible-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="learn-tab-0" tabindex="0">
        <img src="/viz-case/learning-01.png" alt="复杂配置" width="3840" height="2160" />
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="shell section flexible-section" id="visual">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="overline">04 / 方案设计·优化视效</p>
        <h2>从界面到图表，建立清晰而一致的表达</h2>
        <p>精致度服务于辨识和阅读。界面用层级突出字段与结果，图表则通过配色研究提升区分度与使用舒适度</p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="flexible-tabs"
        style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))"
        role="tablist"
        aria-label="优化视效方案"
      >
        {[
          ['图形与界面', '让重要信息先被看见'],
          ['图表配色', '从行业特征到实际可读性'],
        ].map(([title, description], index) => (
          <button
            id={`visual-tab-${index}`}
            class="flexible-tab"
            type="button"
            role="tab"
            aria-selected={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}
            aria-controls="visual-panel"
            tabindex={index === 0 ? 0 : -1}
          >
            <span>{title}</span>
            <small>{description}</small>
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div
        id="visual-panel"
        class="flexible-panel visual-panel"
        role="tabpanel"
        aria-labelledby="visual-tab-0"
        tabindex="0"
      >
        <img src="/viz-case/visual-01.png" alt="图形与界面" width="3840" height="2160" />
        <img src="/viz-case/visual-02.png" alt="图形与界面补充" width="3840" height="2160" />
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="validation" id="validation">
      <div class="shell section validation-inner">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="overline">05 / 测试验证</p>
          <h2>设计完成后，还要验证用户能否真正用起来</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="validation-grid">
          <div class="validation-step">
            <h3>
              <span>1. </span>征询意见
            </h3>
            <p>分享关键产出，收集反馈，并提前传达变化，让用户有充足心理缓冲适应新变化</p>
            <div class="validation-image-frame">
              <img src="/viz-case/testing-01.png?v=de363c02706d" alt="征询用户意见" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="validation-step">
            <h3>
              <span>2. </span>分期验证
            </h3>
            <p>拆为四期上线，每期在测试环境开展可用性测试，收集用户反馈，优化问题</p>
            <div class="validation-image-frame">
              <img
                class="testing-overlap"
                src="/viz-case/testing-02.png?v=11719133bc94"
                alt="可用性测试脚本与用户反馈"
                loading="lazy"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="validation-step">
            <h3>
              <span>3. </span>监测与回访
            </h3>
            <p>关注新版表现，也主动了解旧版用户继续保留旧习惯的原因</p>
            <div class="validation-image-frame">
              <img src="/viz-case/testing-03.png?v=aca55a0c2bf7" alt="用户监测与回访" loading="lazy" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="validation-step validation-result">
          <h3>
            <span>4. </span>整体项目结果验证
          </h3>
          <p>
            整体项目耗时半年，可视化查询模块全量灰度前，我们对用户发起了一次新版的使用培训，在培训弹幕中，老用户们均表示新版更有吸引力，比原来更好用，模块上线1个月后，旧版UV逐步下降，新版UV波动上升，新版的UV占比均值为66.4%，2个月后，老版完全下线，未引发任何用户负面反馈
          </p>
          <img src="/viz-case/testing-04.png" alt="项目培训反馈与新版 UV 结果验证" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="validation project-summary" id="summary">
      <div class="shell section validation-inner">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="overline">06 / 项目总结</p>
          <h2>让一次重构，成为后续迭代的起点</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="validation-grid">
          {[
            ['体验监测看板', '建立体验监测看板，监测核心行为数据的变化，也为后续功能迭代优化提供数据依据'],
            ['重构方法总结', '梳理和总结重构的思路和经验教训，为其他模块重构提供参考，也扩大设计影响力'],
            ['筛选组件合集', '共用组件如筛选器，总结设计方法，沉淀设计资源，方便团队小伙伴以后拿来即用'],
          ].map(([title, description], index) => (
            <div class="validation-step">
              <h3>
                <span>{index + 1}. </span>
                {title}
              </h3>
              <p>{description}</p>
              <div class="summary-image">
                <img src={`/viz-case/summary-0${index + 1}.png`} alt={title} loading="lazy" />
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="shell">
      <a class="return" href="/">
        返回作品集 ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </article>
  <dialog id="viz-reader">
    <button class="close">关闭 ×</button>
    <img src={a('hero')} alt="设计方案放大预览" />
  </dialog>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.flexible-section').forEach((root) => {
    const tabs = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.flexible-tab'));
    const panel = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.flexible-panel')!;
    const prefix =
      root.id === 'visual'
        ? 'visual'
        : root.id === 'learning'
          ? 'learning'
          : root.id === 'efficiency'
            ? 'efficiency'
            : 'flexible';
    const slides = tabs.map((tab, i) => {
      const slide = document.createElement('div');
      slide.style.cssText = 'position:absolute;inset:0;transform:translateX(100%);border-radius:0';
      const count = root.id === 'visual' ? 2 : 1;
      for (let j = 0; j < count; j++) {
        const img = new Image();
        img.src = `/viz-case/${prefix}-0${i * count + j + 1}.png`;
        img.alt = tab.querySelector('span')!.textContent!;
        img.width = 3840;
        img.height = 2160;
        slide.append(img);
      }
      return slide;
    });
    panel.replaceChildren(...slides);
    slides[0].style.transform = 'translateX(0)';
    let current = 0,
      request = 0;
    let timer: ReturnType<typeof setTimeout>;
    let animations: Animation[] = [];
    const select = async (next: number) => {
      clearTimeout(timer);
      const token = ++request;
      await Promise.all(Array.from(slides[next].querySelectorAll('img')).map((img) => img.decode().catch(() => {})));
      if (token !== request) return;
      animations.forEach((a) => a.cancel());
      animations = [];
      slides.forEach((img, i) => {
        img.style.transform = i === current ? 'translateX(0)' : 'translateX(100%)';
      });
      tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {
        tab.setAttribute('aria-selected', String(i === next));
        tab.tabIndex = i === next ? 0 : -1;
        const bar = tab.querySelector<HTMLElement>('i')!;
        bar.style.animation = 'none';
        void bar.offsetWidth;
        bar.style.animation = '';
      });
      panel.setAttribute('aria-labelledby', tabs[next].id);
      if (next !== current && !matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
        const options = { duration: 520, easing: 'cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)' };
        animations.push(
          slides[current].animate([{ transform: 'translateX(0)' }, { transform: 'translateX(-100%)' }], options),
        );
        animations.push(
          slides[next].animate([{ transform: 'translateX(100%)' }, { transform: 'translateX(0)' }], options),
        );
      }
      slides[current].style.transform = 'translateX(-100%)';
      slides[next].style.transform = 'translateX(0)';
      current = next;
      timer = setTimeout(() => select((current + 1) % tabs.length), 8000);
    };
    tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {
      tab.addEventListener('click', () => select(i));
      tab.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
        let next = i;
        if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') next = (i + 1) % tabs.length;
        else if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') next = (i + tabs.length - 1) % tabs.length;
        else if (e.key === 'Home') next = 0;
        else if (e.key === 'End') next = tabs.length - 1;
        else return;
        e.preventDefault();
        select(next);
        tabs[next].focus();
      });
    });
    select(0);
    document.addEventListener(
      'astro:before-swap',
      () => {
        ++request;
        clearTimeout(timer);
        animations.forEach((a) => a.cancel());
      },
      { once: true },
    );
  });
  const chapterLinks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('.strategy-nav a'));
  const chapterObserver = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
        chapterLinks.forEach((link) => {
          if (link.hash === '#' + entry.target.id) link.setAttribute('aria-current', 'true');
          else link.removeAttribute('aria-current');
        });
      });
    },
    { rootMargin: '-15% 0px -65% 0px' },
  );
  document.querySelectorAll('.chapter').forEach((section) => chapterObserver.observe(section));
  document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap', () => chapterObserver.disconnect(), { once: true });
  const dialog = document.querySelector<HTMLDialogElement>('#viz-reader');
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-src]').forEach((b) =>
    b.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (dialog) {
        dialog.querySelector('img')!.src = b.dataset.src!;
        dialog.showModal();
      }
    }),
  );
  dialog?.querySelector('button')?.addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
  dialog?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    if (e.target === dialog) dialog.close();
  });
</script>
<style>
  .project-summary .summary-image {
    margin-top: auto;
  }
  .project-summary .summary-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .viz-case .validation {
    background: #1e1f20;
    margin-top: 96px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }
  .viz-case .project-summary {
    margin-top: 0;
    padding-bottom: 128px;
  }
  .validation-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 64px;
  }
  .viz-case .validation .overline {
    color: #c7c7bf;
  }
  .viz-case .validation .overline::before {
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px #525252;
  }
  .validation h2,
  .validation h3 {
    color: #fafaf7;
  }
  .validation-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .validation-step {
    border-top: 1px solid #55554e;
    padding-top: 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .validation-step h3 {
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .validation-step h3 span {
    color: #d4f84a;
  }
  .validation-step p {
    color: #c7c7bf;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .validation-step img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 430px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: bottom;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .validation-step img.testing-overlap {
    height: 430px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: bottom;
  }
  .validation-image-frame {
    height: 430px;
    margin-top: auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }
  .validation-grid .validation-image-frame img {
    width: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 420px;
    object-fit: contain;
    flex-shrink: 1;
  }
  .validation-result img {
    margin-top: 20px;
    height: auto;
    max-height: 636px;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .validation-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .validation-step img {
      height: auto;
    }
  }

  .flexible-section {
    scroll-margin-top: 100px;
  }
  .flexible-section .section-heading > p:last-child:not(.overline) {
    max-width: 900px;
  }
  .flexible-tabs {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 56px;
  }
